---
// JWT Standard 3-Part Structure (Header . Payload . Signature) Diagram Component
---

<figure class="jwts-diag" aria-labelledby="jwts-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="jwts-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 180"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="jwts-diag-title jwts-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="jwts-diag-title">JWT 三段式緊湊編碼結構示意圖</title>
    <desc id="jwts-diag-desc">
      展示 JSON Web Token
      標準三段式格式：Header（演算法與類型）、Payload（身份實體宣告與過期時間）與
      Signature（數位簽名防偽）。
    </desc>

    <!-- Background Card -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="145"
      rx="12"
      class="jwts-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Part 1: Header (x: 45, width: 235) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 30)">
      <rect
        width="235"
        height="110"
        rx="8"
        class="jwts-diag__part-box jwts-diag__part-box--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="28"
        class="jwts-diag__part-title jwts-diag__part-title--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        1. Header (標頭)
      </text>
      <rect
        x="20"
        y="42"
        width="195"
        height="52"
        rx="4"
        class="jwts-diag__code-pill"></rect>
      <text x="30" y="62" class="jwts-diag__code-text">"alg": "RS256",</text>
      <text x="30" y="80" class="jwts-diag__code-text">"typ": "JWT"</text>
    </g>

    <!-- Dot Separator 1 -->
    <text x="300" y="96" class="jwts-diag__dot" text-anchor="middle">.</text>

    <!-- Part 2: Payload (x: 320, width: 240) -->
    <g transform="translate(320, 30)">
      <rect
        width="240"
        height="110"
        rx="8"
        class="jwts-diag__part-box jwts-diag__part-box--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="120"
        y="28"
        class="jwts-diag__part-title jwts-diag__part-title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2. Payload (負載 Claims)
      </text>
      <rect
        x="20"
        y="42"
        width="200"
        height="52"
        rx="4"
        class="jwts-diag__code-pill"></rect>
      <text x="30" y="62" class="jwts-diag__code-text"
        >"sub": "user_42", "role": "editor",</text
      >
      <text x="30" y="80" class="jwts-diag__code-text">"exp": 1772640000</text>
    </g>

    <!-- Dot Separator 2 -->
    <text x="580" y="96" class="jwts-diag__dot" text-anchor="middle">.</text>

    <!-- Part 3: Signature (x: 600, width: 235) -->
    <g transform="translate(600, 30)">
      <rect
        width="235"
        height="110"
        rx="8"
        class="jwts-diag__part-box jwts-diag__part-box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="28"
        class="jwts-diag__part-title jwts-diag__part-title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        3. Signature (數位防偽簽名)
      </text>
      <rect
        x="18"
        y="42"
        width="199"
        height="52"
        rx="4"
        class="jwts-diag__code-pill"></rect>
      <text x="28" y="62" class="jwts-diag__code-text">RSASHA256(</text>
      <text x="28" y="80" class="jwts-diag__code-text">
        base64(H) + "." + base64(P), key)</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="jwts-diag__mobile">
    <div class="jwts-mobile-card jwts-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="jwts-mobile-badge jwts-mobile-badge--red"
        >PART 1: HEADER</span
      >
      <h4>1. 標頭 (Header)</h4>
      <p>
        定義簽名演算法與權杖型態：<code
          >&#123; "alg": "RS256", "typ": "JWT" &#125;</code
        >
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="jwts-mobile-arrow">. (Base64Url 編碼串接)</div>

    <div class="jwts-mobile-card jwts-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="jwts-mobile-badge jwts-mobile-badge--purple"
        >PART 2: PAYLOAD</span
      >
      <h4>2. 負載 (Payload Claims)</h4>
      <p>
        攜帶主體身份與宣告資料：<code
          >&#123; "sub": "42", "role": "editor", "exp": 1772640000 &#125;</code
        >
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="jwts-mobile-arrow">. (Base64Url 編碼串接)</div>

    <div class="jwts-mobile-card jwts-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="jwts-mobile-badge jwts-mobile-badge--green"
        >PART 3: SIGNATURE</span
      >
      <h4>3. 數位防偽簽名 (Signature)</h4>
      <p>
        由伺服器私鑰或密鑰對前兩部分進行雜湊簽名，任何篡改皆會導致簽名校驗崩潰！
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="jwts-diag-caption" class="jwts-diag__caption">
    圖二：JSON Web Token（JWT）標準三段式結構與防偽簽名編排
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .jwts-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .jwts-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .jwts-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .jwts-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .jwts-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-box {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-box--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    stroke: #dc2626;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-diag__part-box--red {
    fill: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.14);
    stroke: #f87171;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-box--purple {
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04);
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-diag__part-box--purple {
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.14);
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-box--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-diag__part-box--green {
    fill: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.14);
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-title--red {
    fill: #b91c1c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-diag__part-title--red {
    fill: #fca5a5;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-title--purple {
    fill: #6d28d9;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-diag__part-title--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .jwts-diag__part-title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-diag__part-title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .jwts-diag__code-pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .jwts-diag__code-text {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .jwts-diag__dot {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  /* Mobile View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .jwts-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .jwts-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-card--red {
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-mobile-card--red {
      background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.12);
      border-color: #f87171;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-mobile-card--purple {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
      border-color: #a78bfa;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.12);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .jwts-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #dc2626;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-mobile-badge--red {
      color: #fca5a5;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jwts-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .jwts-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.2rem 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-card code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface-2);
      padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .jwts-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
